Notes on process
IOT device Id are Ixxx where xxx are alphanumeric characters 0-9, A-Z
Sensor device Id are Jxxx where xxx are alphanumeric characters 0-9, A-Z

all apps are executable python scripts that run from command line
rf_config.py is the main configuration script that sets up the RF device
It takes as arguments the device ID and configuration commands
serial_mon.py is the serial monitor that displays incoming messages from the RF device

git add --chmod=+x filename.sh




